[{"answer":"Hi Don.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/1_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you get the copy of the article on recycling footwear that I emailed you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/2_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah it's here...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/3_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I've had a look at it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/4_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So do you think it's a good topic for our presentation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/5_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, before I started reading it, I thought recycling footwear...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/6_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"well, although it's quite interesting, perhaps there isn't enough to say about it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/7_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"cos we put shoes in recycling bins, they go to charity shops and that's about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/8_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"But there's much more to it than that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/9_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I realise that now and I'm keen to research the topic more.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/10_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/11_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"One of the things I didn't realise until I read the article was just how many pairs of trainers get recycled!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/12_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, a lot of young people wear them all the time now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/13_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"They've become more popular than ordinary shoes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/14_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/15_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess they are very hard-wearing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/16_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but don't they look a bit casual for school uniform?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/17_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think they're right for that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/18_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, I think some of them look quite smart on pupils...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/19_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Better than a scruffy old pair of shoes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/20_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So do you keep shoes a long time?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/21_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/22_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Though I do tend to wear my old pairs for doing dirty jobs like cleaning my bike.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/23_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I must admit,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/24_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I've recycled some perfectly good shoes, that haven't gone out of fashion and still fit,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/25_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"just because they don't look great on me anymore.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/26_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's awful, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/27_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it's common because there's so much choice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/28_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The article did say that recent sales of footwear have increased enormously.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/29_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That didn't surprise me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/30_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/31_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"But then it said that the amount of recycled footwear has fallen:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/32_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"it's 6% now compared to a previous level of 11%.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/33_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That doesn't seem to make sense.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/34_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's because not everything goes through the recycling process.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/35_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Some footwear just isn't good enough to re-sell, for one reason or another, and gets rejected.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/36_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So let's find some examples in the article of footwear that was rejected for recycling.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/37_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/38_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I think there are some in the interview with the recycling manager.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/39_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah... here it is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/40_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's start with the ladies' high-heeled shoes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/41_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"What did he say about those?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/42_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He said they were probably expensive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/43_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The material was suede and they were beige in colour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/44_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It looked like someone had only worn them once, but in a very wet field","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/45_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"so the heels were too stained with mud and grass to re-sell them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/46_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/47_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And the leather ankle boots.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/48_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"What was wrong with them?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/49_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Apparently, the heels were worn","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/50_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but that wasn't the problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/51_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"One of the shoes was a much lighter shade than the other one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/52_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It'd obviously been left in the sun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/53_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose even second-hand shoes should look the same!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/54_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/55_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there were the red baby shoes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/56_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/57_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"we're told to tie shoes together when we put them in a recycling bin,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/58_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but people often don't bother.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/59_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You'd think it would have been easy to find the other, but it wasn't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/60_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That was a shame because they were obviously new.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/61_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The trainers were interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/62_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He said they looked like they'd been worn by a marathon runner.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/63_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah... weren't they split?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/64_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Not exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/65_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"One of the soles was so worn under the foot that you could put your finger through it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/66_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we could certainly use some of those examples in our presentation to explain why 90% of shoes that people take to recycling centres or bins get thrown into landfill.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/67_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"What did you think about the project his team set up to avoid this by making new shoes out of the good parts of old shoes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/68_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounded like a good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/69_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"They get so many shoes, they should be able to match parts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/70_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I wasn't surprised that it failed, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/71_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean who wants to buy second-hand shoes really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/72_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Think of all the germs you could catch!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/73_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, people didn't refuse them for that reason, did they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/74_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It was because the pairs of shoes weren't identical.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/75_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"They still managed to ship them overseas, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/76_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's another area we need to discuss.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/77_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You know I used to consider this topic just from my own perspective,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/78_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"by thinking about my own recycling behaviour without looking at the bigger picture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/79_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So much happens once shoes leave the recycling area.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/80_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's not as simple as you first think,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/81_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and we can show that by taking a very different approach to it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/82_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/83_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So let's discuss...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-3-2024-06-21-00-22-45/84_v3.mp3"}]
